Subject: [PATCH] Fix launch heart-rate limits, add invariant tests, Thresholds
 page and front-end tests

Back-end: the launch heart-rate allowance (+30 bpm) also raised the lower
limits, so a calm 73 bpm was critical during launch. It is now a one-sided
tolerance on the upper limits only. Adds invariant tests over every crew
member, profile and environment, with regression tests for the fix.

Front-end: new Thresholds page (days in environment, where the baseline was
recorded, environment detection, limits in force with latest status, chart
against the limits, sources) in English and Arabic, dark and light. Adds
front-end tests (node:test) for its logic and for translation completeness,
and runs them in CI.

